      "text": "==> Answer :\n    ° managed open data hub\n    ° Which is the name it has before RHODS \n      which is the oldest name for the product\n      (Red Hat OpenShift Data Science) \n      and then it was renamed to RHOAI(Red Hat OpenShift AI)",
